OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Why Trump's new tariffs  
OL,4,Aare less of a threat                   
OL,6,FThere was none of last April's fanfare,
OL,7,Fthe Rose Garden reveal, the gameshow   
OL,8,Fblue board or "Liberation Day" rhetoric
OL,9,Fsurrounding Trump's tariff announcement
OL,10,Fthis week.                             
OL,12,FInstead there is something rather      
OL,13,Ftentative about this latest exercise   
OL,14,Fwith talk of further negotiations.     
OL,16,F"We expect to have a broad, even a     
OL,17,Fplurilateral negotiation to talk about 
OL,18,Fexcess capacity and how to resolve it,"
OL,19,FUS Trade Representative Jamieson Greer 
OL,20,Ftold CNBC.                             
