OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Why Trump's new tariffs  
OL,4,Aare less of a threat                   
OL,6,FAround the world the view is that this 
OL,7,Fweek's announcement is an attempt to   
OL,8,Fshore up the domestic legal            
OL,9,Funderpinning of these tariffs, more    
OL,10,Fthan a fundamental change in the Trump 
OL,11,Ftrade agenda.                          
